    "turn_text": "Absolutely, Jason. So without further ado, let's jump right into the conversation with the Congressman. Congressman, welcome to the podcast here this afternoon. Great to have you on. Before we jump into the interview, I know you're a fourth-generation family farmer, so I just wanted to ask how are conditions looking back home? How's the weather look or the crops getting planted at a decent pace this year?",
