    "turn_text": "You know, sticking with that, you know, you talked about conservation and some of the conservation aspects of the farm bill. And, you know, when we, when we talk about conservation, when we talk about environmental type issues, that can be a big concern for farmers. Sometimes, you know, the, we hear talk about the, what is the U.S. rule from the EPA or pesticide registration complexities and things like that. Do you have any insight on, on those kinds of topics? And like you said, farmers would obviously prefer that a lot of things would remain voluntary. Where do you kind of see those kind of things heading?",
