    "turn_idx": 21,
    "turn_text": "When it comes to these kind of things, like you mentioned, and we talked about farmers have some concern about certain things that go on. Obviously voting is a big thing that's important, but what other advice do you have for farmers that they can get involved? How can farmers and people that really care about these topics influence policy?",
