        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "Food security is linked to national security.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "If farmers continue to avoid public engagement, they risk losing public understanding of agricultural challenges and food production.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
